      "content": "thanks. the senator feels a bit too \"perfect\" though. can u make his arguments feel more heavyweight and authoritative? like, use some more complex political theory or logic to make him sound like a real statesman. also, can the activist's part be a bit more... well, less coherent? maybe more frantic and based on just fear and gut feelings so the senator looks even more like the smart one in the room.",
